<title>PHILIPPINES: Cebu Holdings to raise capital stock.</title>
<headline>Cebu Holdings to raise capital stock.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1997-04-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Cebu Holdings Inc said on Thursday its board had approved a resolution increasing its authorised capital stock to 3.0 billion pesos from the present 2.0 billion pesos.</p>
<p>The company did not say in its statement how it would finance the capital increase.</p>
<p>Cebu Holdings is a subsidiary of real estate firm Ayala Land Inc.</p>
<p>- Manila newsroom 63 2 8418938 Fax 8176267</p>
</text>
